        const val REFERENCE_DEVICE_NOTE =
            "Measured on the Poco X5 Pro 5G (SM7325 / Android 14 / Adreno 642L). AC15: " +
                "these are REAL reference-device numbers but they bind NEITHER PERF-002 " +
                "NOR PERF-010 — both re-baseline with Story 12.3, and PERF-010 is a SOFT " +
                "target, not a measured floor. The engine brief's <10 s is the " +
